WEBVTT
Kind: captions

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:02.285 position:63%
This is the oil sniffer

00:00:02.285 --> 00:00:04.790 position:63%
a plane loaded with&nbsp;top secret equipment 

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:06.850 position:63%
designed to detect oil. 

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:08.431 position:63%
By&nbsp;simply flying over land

00:00:08.431 --> 00:00:10.179 position:63%
it could map out entire&nbsp;deposits 

00:00:10.179 --> 00:00:13.837 position:63%
miles beneath the surface with incredible&nbsp;accuracy. 

00:00:13.837 --> 00:00:15.676 position:63%
When it first appeared in the 70s

00:00:15.676 --> 00:00:18.556 position:63%
it&nbsp;promised to give countries a massive advantage,

00:00:18.556 --> 00:00:21.495 position:63%
allowing them to find and produce their&nbsp;own oil 

00:00:21.495 --> 00:00:23.411 position:63%
much more easily. 

00:00:23.411 --> 00:00:26.667 position:63%
That was if it&nbsp;was actually real. 

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:29.817 position:63%
This is the story of two&nbsp;men who throughout the 70s 

00:00:29.817 --> 00:00:34.379 position:63%
tricked an entire&nbsp;country into 
spending billions on their fake&nbsp;machine

00:00:34.379 --> 00:00:37.116 position:63%
 without finding a single drop of oil.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.116 --> 00:00:38.911 position:63%
We modeled the entire thing 

00:00:38.911 --> 00:00:41.689 position:63%
to show you how the&nbsp;device actually worked 

00:00:41.689 --> 00:00:43.894 position:63%
and the mysterious network&nbsp;of people 

00:00:43.894 --> 00:00:46.101 position:63%
behind the scam. &nbsp;

00:00:46.101 --> 00:00:47.669 position:63%
In the mid 70s&nbsp;

00:00:47.669 --> 00:00:49.837 position:63%
the&nbsp;world was going through a crisis,

00:00:49.837 --> 00:00:51.837 position:63%
an oil crisis.&nbsp;

00:00:51.837 --> 00:00:53.185 position:63%
Middle Eastern countries 

00:00:53.185 --> 00:00:55.416 position:63%
had placed an embargo&nbsp;on their oil

00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:57.200 position:63%
causing prices around the world 

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.651 position:63%
to skyrocket by over 300%&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:00.651 --> 00:01:03.430 position:63%
Getting oil became a&nbsp;national priority.&nbsp;

00:01:03.430 --> 00:01:05.000 position:63%
Especially for France

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.582 position:63%
which, at this point was 
entirely dependent on outside&nbsp;oil. 

00:01:09.582 --> 00:01:12.000 position:63%
With its reserves getting desperately low,

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.272 position:63%
France decided to start looking for its own oil.&nbsp;

00:01:15.272 --> 00:01:17.146 position:63%
That's where these two came in. 

00:01:17.146 --> 00:01:20.108 position:63%
Aldo Bonassoli, a physicist from Italy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.108 --> 00:01:23.897 position:63%
and Alan de Villegas, an aristocrat&nbsp;from Belgium. 

00:01:23.897 --> 00:01:26.168 position:63%
They had worked together for over a&nbsp;decade,

00:01:26.168 --> 00:01:28.443 position:63%
inventing a device capable of detecting&nbsp;

00:01:28.443 --> 00:01:32.080 position:63%
water and minerals deep beneath the surface.&nbsp;

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.263 position:63%
To take advantage of the current crisis

00:01:34.263 --> 00:01:36.641 position:63%
their&nbsp;next invention seemed obvious, 

00:01:36.641 --> 00:01:38.641 position:63%
an oil detector.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.641 --> 00:01:40.862 position:63%
They came up with an electrical device that&nbsp;could 

00:01:40.862 --> 00:01:43.175 position:63%
simply scan the surface from above

00:01:43.175 --> 00:01:45.000 position:63%
drastically reducing the cost 

00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:47.757 position:63%
and time required to&nbsp;find oil. 

00:01:47.757 --> 00:01:50.451 position:63%
To get their invention in front of the right people

00:01:50.451 --> 00:01:53.133 position:63%
the two inventors had a secret&nbsp;weapon,

00:01:53.133 --> 00:01:54.776 position:63%
Jean Violet

00:01:54.776 --> 00:01:58.620 position:63%
a French lawyer who had 
connections at every level of society. &nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.620 --> 00:02:01.680 position:63%
He put&nbsp;the inventors in 
touch with officials from elf,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.680 --> 00:02:04.233 position:63%
France's state-owned oil company. 

00:02:04.233 --> 00:02:05.000 position:63%
At the time

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.799 position:63%
elf had almost completely run out of oil. 

00:02:07.799 --> 00:02:12.779 position:63%
So they were instantly hooked
by the idea of an oil&nbsp;detecting plane. 

00:02:12.779 --> 00:02:15.157 position:63%
And so, in May 1976

00:02:15.157 --> 00:02:17.362 position:63%
the device&nbsp;was loaded onto a plane,&nbsp;

00:02:17.362 --> 00:02:20.994 position:63%
and the two inventors,&nbsp;along with elf's top officials

00:02:20.994 --> 00:02:22.697 position:63%
 took to the&nbsp;skies. &nbsp;

00:02:22.697 --> 00:02:23.858 position:63%
According to Aldo,

00:02:23.858 --> 00:02:25.858 position:63%
his device could send&nbsp;out a signal 

00:02:25.858 --> 00:02:30.142 position:63%
and detect the gravitational 
waves given off by the oil deposits.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:30.142 --> 00:02:33.206 position:63%
Aldo refused to&nbsp;give away any more info. 

00:02:33.206 --> 00:02:34.720 position:63%
But to elf's officials,&nbsp;

00:02:34.720 --> 00:02:38.114 position:63%
this explanation sounded revolutionary. 

00:02:38.114 --> 00:02:40.661 position:63%
To test&nbsp;that the device actually worked, 

00:02:40.661 --> 00:02:44.388 position:63%
elf officials told the pilots 
to fly over a specific location 

00:02:44.388 --> 00:02:47.520 position:63%
where they knew an oil deposit already existed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:48.993 position:63%
If the device worked

00:02:48.993 --> 00:02:53.032 position:63%
the oil deposit should show&nbsp;up in the same location. 

00:02:53.032 --> 00:02:55.931 position:63%
Sure enough, as they flew&nbsp;over the target&nbsp;

00:02:55.931 --> 00:02:57.710 position:63%
 the device started to beep 

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:01.098 position:63%
and&nbsp;images started to 
appear on the detection screen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:01.098 --> 00:03:04.344 position:63%
Amazingly, the device was spot on. 

00:03:04.344 --> 00:03:06.720 position:63%
Not&nbsp;only did it match the correct location,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.720 --> 00:03:12.717 position:63%
but the device mapped out the exact 
shape of the&nbsp;oil field in surprisingly great detail. 

00:03:12.717 --> 00:03:13.600 position:63%
To elf

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:17.606 position:63%
it really seemed like they had found 
the holy&nbsp;grail of oil exploration

00:03:17.606 --> 00:03:21.853 position:63%
and they were desperate&nbsp;not to 
let other countries get their hands on it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.853 --> 00:03:24.385 position:63%
And so in May 1976, 

00:03:24.385 --> 00:03:26.698 position:63%
elf signed a contract with the two inventors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.698 --> 00:03:30.134 position:63%
for an incredible $200 million Swiss&nbsp;Francs,

00:03:30.134 --> 00:03:33.585 position:63%
around half a billion dollars in today's money. &nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:33.585 --> 00:03:36.337 position:63%
But that's where things get interesting.

00:03:36.337 --> 00:03:38.842 position:63%
The contract was actually set up between elf 

00:03:38.842 --> 00:03:42.075 position:63%
and&nbsp;a company in Panama called Fisalma

00:03:42.075 --> 00:03:44.208 position:63%
run by the&nbsp;two inventors. 

00:03:44.208 --> 00:03:46.353 position:63%
With the help of the French Prime&nbsp;Minister 

00:03:46.353 --> 00:03:47.952 position:63%
and the head of the Swiss bank, 

00:03:47.952 --> 00:03:49.952 position:63%
the deal&nbsp;was done. 

00:03:49.952 --> 00:03:52.514 position:63%
Now with exclusive rights to the device,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:52.514 --> 00:03:55.587 position:63%
elf and the inventors got to work. 

00:03:55.587 --> 00:03:58.194 position:63%
Over the&nbsp;next year, they flew multiple secret flights,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:58.194 --> 00:04:02.743 position:63%
successfully finding oil deposits 
all over Europe&nbsp;and South Africa. 

00:04:02.743 --> 00:04:05.350 position:63%
To start reaping the benefits of&nbsp;their investment, &nbsp;

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:07.844 position:63%
elf set up two drilling points.&nbsp;

00:04:07.844 --> 00:04:09.760 position:63%
But after months of drilling,

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:12.953 position:63%
 not a single drop&nbsp;of oil was found. &nbsp;

00:04:12.953 --> 00:04:15.213 position:63%
Something clearly wasn't right.&nbsp;

00:04:15.213 --> 00:04:17.507 position:63%
But Aldo fully believed in his device 

00:04:17.507 --> 00:04:20.090 position:63%
and told elf that if they had just kept digging, 

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:22.680 position:63%
they would&nbsp;have found the oil deposit. 

00:04:22.680 --> 00:04:27.788 position:63%
He also recommended they use Odoo 
to manage the next drilling project.&nbsp;

00:04:27.788 --> 00:04:28.963 position:63%
Just kidding.

00:04:28.963 --> 00:04:32.330 position:63%
Odoo is an all-in-one 
business&nbsp;management platform

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:35.262 position:63%
that offers entrepreneurs more&nbsp;than 70 apps

00:04:35.262 --> 00:04:37.262 position:63%
to help with managing their business&nbsp;

00:04:37.280 --> 00:04:43.280 position:63%
from sales, invoicing, accounting, project&nbsp;
management, website creation, and so much more.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.201 position:63%
What makes Odoo really powerful 

