check out the link in&nbsp;the description &nbsp;

00:05:45.191 --> 00:05:48.139 position:63%
or scan the QR code here on the&nbsp;screen. 

00:05:48.139 --> 00:05:51.440 position:63%
After almost a year of constant drilling,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:51.440 --> 00:05:55.255 position:63%
elf still hadn't found a single drop of oil. 

00:05:55.255 --> 00:05:57.970 position:63%
The&nbsp;device had led the company to a dead end, 

00:05:57.970 --> 00:06:01.081 position:63%
and&nbsp;elf's officials were starting to get suspicious.&nbsp;

00:06:01.081 --> 00:06:04.721 position:63%
But things were about to 
get a whole lot more&nbsp;complicated. &nbsp;

00:06:04.721 --> 00:06:06.769 position:63%
During the next exploration flight,&nbsp;

00:06:06.769 --> 00:06:10.829 position:63%
Aldo announced that his device 
had picked up&nbsp;something unusual.&nbsp;

00:06:10.829 --> 00:06:14.680 position:63%
While flying over the sea, it&nbsp;had detected a faint trail

00:06:14.680 --> 00:06:18.611 position:63%
which he claimed was the 
radiation from a nuclear submarine.

00:06:18.611 --> 00:06:20.768 position:63%
elf took&nbsp;this report to the French military

00:06:20.768 --> 00:06:21.840 position:63%
and amazingly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.840 --> 00:06:26.309 position:63%
they confirmed that it matched the 
real location&nbsp;of a French submarine. 

00:06:26.309 --> 00:06:29.862 position:63%
Not only were elf now fully convinced by the device,

00:06:29.862 --> 00:06:33.592 position:63%
but the French&nbsp;military 
had now declared it as top secret. 

00:06:33.592 --> 00:06:36.378 position:63%
To&nbsp;avoid the device falling 
into the hands of another&nbsp;country, 

00:06:36.378 --> 00:06:39.787 position:63%
elf signed yet another contract with the&nbsp;inventors. 

00:06:39.787 --> 00:06:43.465 position:63%
This time for 250 million Francs. 

00:06:43.465 --> 00:06:45.465 position:63%
A&nbsp;whole fleet of planes were bought, 

00:06:45.465 --> 00:06:46.766 position:63%
employees were&nbsp;hired, 

00:06:46.766 --> 00:06:51.282 position:63%
and the company started expanding 
their&nbsp;sniffing business all over Europe. 

00:06:51.282 --> 00:06:54.435 position:63%
elf had pinned&nbsp;its entire hopes on this device. &nbsp;

00:06:54.435 --> 00:06:58.413 position:63%
And yet, they&nbsp;still hadn't found a single drop of oil. 

00:06:58.413 --> 00:07:00.158 position:63%
Why were&nbsp;they falling for this? &nbsp;

00:07:00.158 --> 00:07:03.365 position:63%
How could the officials&nbsp;not 
see that they were being played? 

00:07:03.365 --> 00:07:05.552 position:63%
Something clearly wasn't right, &nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:05.552 --> 00:07:08.438 position:63%
and it was all about to&nbsp;come crashing down. 

00:07:08.438 --> 00:07:10.270 position:63%
At the end of 1977

00:07:10.270 --> 00:07:12.138 position:63%
elf's CEO&nbsp;retired, &nbsp;

00:07:12.138 --> 00:07:15.120 position:63%
leaving the new CEO to run the company.&nbsp;

00:07:15.120 --> 00:07:18.465 position:63%
Bit by bit, he was introduced to the Sniffer&nbsp;Project, 

00:07:18.465 --> 00:07:21.801 position:63%
which at this point was still a closely&nbsp;kept secret. 

00:07:21.801 --> 00:07:23.840 position:63%
But after several more failures,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:26.136 position:63%
the relationship with the inventors turned &nbsp;

00:07:26.136 --> 00:07:28.998 position:63%
and he&nbsp;became suspicious of the whole project. 

00:07:28.998 --> 00:07:31.350 position:63%
And so on&nbsp;the next exploration flight, 

00:07:31.350 --> 00:07:33.784 position:63%
he brought along&nbsp;physicist Jules Horowitz 

00:07:33.784 --> 00:07:36.160 position:63%
to analyze the device.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:39.680 position:63%
Since the device could in theory 
see through&nbsp;anything, 

00:07:39.680 --> 00:07:42.560 position:63%
Aldo offered to perform a simple test.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.745 position:63%
He gave Horowitz a metal ruler 

00:07:44.745 --> 00:07:47.250 position:63%
and told him to&nbsp;place it on the detector plate

00:07:47.250 --> 00:07:48.887 position:63%
which was behind&nbsp;a curtain. 

00:07:48.887 --> 00:07:49.757 position:63%
Meanwhile, 

00:07:49.757 --> 00:07:52.220 position:63%
the screen in front of the&nbsp;device displayed an image 

00:07:52.220 --> 00:07:54.823 position:63%
that perfectly resembled&nbsp;the shape of a ruler. &nbsp;

00:07:54.823 --> 00:07:56.424 position:63%
So far so good. 

00:07:56.424 --> 00:08:01.154 position:63%
But Horowitz&nbsp;came back 
only to reveal he had bent the ruler,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.154 --> 00:08:04.868 position:63%
proving that the device 
wasn't actually detecting&nbsp;anything.

00:08:04.868 --> 00:08:08.108 position:63%
Aldo had finally been caught red-handed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:08.108 --> 00:08:11.253 position:63%
elf immediately stopped all 
funds going to the&nbsp;inventors 

00:08:11.253 --> 00:08:14.722 position:63%
and seized the device to 
understand&nbsp;what was really going on. &nbsp;

00:08:14.722 --> 00:08:16.790 position:63%
What they found was&nbsp;amazing. 

00:08:16.790 --> 00:08:19.295 position:63%
This is how they had been tricked.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.295 --> 00:08:20.748 position:63%
As it turned out, 

00:08:20.748 --> 00:08:22.685 position:63%
Aldo wasn't a physicist at&nbsp;all

00:08:22.685 --> 00:08:27.061 position:63%
but a TV repair man with expertise in visual effects.

00:08:27.061 --> 00:08:29.553 position:63%
Behind the facade of electrical&nbsp;equipment, 

00:08:29.553 --> 00:08:33.403 position:63%
Aldo's device was really just a large&nbsp;infrared camera. 

00:08:33.403 --> 00:08:34.540 position:63%
Before each flight, 

00:08:34.540 --> 00:08:36.435 position:63%
he painted&nbsp;abstract pictures, 

00:08:36.435 --> 00:08:38.240 position:63%
placed them into a black box,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:41.583 position:63%
and lit them from behind using an infrared lamp.&nbsp;

00:08:41.583 --> 00:08:43.709 position:63%
Since the camera was also infrared, 

00:08:43.709 --> 00:08:48.070 position:63%
the end result was an image 
resembling the natural shape of&nbsp;an oil deposit. &nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:50.714 position:63%
By moving the image 
across the&nbsp;camera's field of view, &nbsp;

00:08:50.714 --> 00:08:54.443 position:63%
it made it look like the&nbsp;plane 
was actually flying over the deposit. 

00:08:54.443 --> 00:08:57.074 position:63%
Aldo recorded these videos onto a VHS tape 

00:08:57.074 --> 00:08:59.537 position:63%
and played&nbsp;them back during the flight. 

00:08:59.537 --> 00:09:00.480 position:63%
At the right moment,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:00.480 --> 00:09:03.763 position:63%
he'd hit play on a remote hidden inside his&nbsp;pocket, 

00:09:03.763 --> 00:09:06.307 position:63%
and the shapes would then pass by the&nbsp;screen

00:09:06.307 --> 00:09:09.842 position:63%
just as they were flying over the real&nbsp;oil deposits. 

00:09:09.842 --> 00:09:12.302 position:63%
In order to know exactly when to hit play, &nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:12.302 --> 00:09:16.301 position:63%
Aldo had been fed data 
directly from a&nbsp;contact inside elf, 

00:09:16.301 --> 00:09:19.287 position:63%
so he knew exactly where the&nbsp;deposits were. 

00:09:19.287 --> 00:09:21.805 position:63%
It was the scam of the century.

00:09:21.805 --> 00:09:25.340 position:63%
More than a billion dollars worth 
of taxpayers money had disappeared,

00:09:25.340 --> 00:09:28.137 position:63%
and France had nothing to&nbsp;show for it. 

00:09:28.137 --> 00:09:29.840 position:63%
The whole thing was so embarrassing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:29.840 --> 00:09:33.433 position:63%
that the prime minister decided
to completely&nbsp;cover up the story. 

00:09:33.433 --> 00:09:35.000 position:63%
Documents were shredded&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:39.417 position:63%
and the two inventors were never charged 
to&nbsp;avoid the story getting out.

00:09:39.417 --> 00:09:40.720 position:63%
 After the scam,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.891 position:63%
Aldo returned to being a TV repairman in Italy.&nbsp;

00:09:43.891 --> 00:09:46.311 position:63%
And Alan, who was completely broke, 

00:09:46.311 --> 00:09:48.811 position:63%
moved to South America.

00:09:48.811 --> 00:09:50.268 position:63%
Wait a minute. 

00:09:50.268 --> 00:09:52.878 position:63%
It may seem like the story&nbsp;is over, 

00:09:52.878 --> 00:09:54.668 position:63%
but after digging a bit deeper, 

00:09:54.668 --> 00:09:58.448 position:63%
it turns&nbsp;out that this scam 
isn't really what it seems.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.448 --> 00:09:59.522 position:63%
 Throughout the whole thing, 

00:09:59.522 --> 00:10:01.792 position:63%
there was a much wider scam going on &nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:01.792 --> 00:10:04.324 position:63%
that went under everyone's noses.&nbsp;

00:10:04.324 --> 00:10:07.375 position:63%
You see, it wasn't really elf that got scammed

00:10:07.375 --> 00:10:11.202 position:63%
and the two inventors weren't really the scam&nbsp;artists. 

00:10:11.202 --> 00:10:13.998 position:63%
Neither of the inventors 
made any&nbsp;money from the scam. &nbsp;

00:10:13.998 --> 00:10:16.193 position:63%
So, what really happened?&nbsp;

00:10:16.193 --> 00:10:17.709 position:63%
Throughout this entire story

00:10:17.709 --> 00:10:20.923 position:63%
there was one name always 
lurking in the background

00:10:20.923 --> 00:10:22.816 position:63%
Jean Violet. 

00:10:22.816 --> 00:10:26.561 position:63%
He&nbsp;was the well-connected lawyer 
that had introduced the inventors to elf. &nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.561 --> 00:10:29.463 position:63%
But his involvement ran much&nbsp;deeper than that. 

00:10:29.463 --> 00:10:31.797 position:63%
He wasn't just a well-connected&nbsp;lawyer. 

00:10:31.797 --> 00:10:36.716 position:63%
He was part of several highly exclusive&nbsp;
political groups and private clubs. 

00:10:36.716 --> 00:10:38.672 position:63%
He was the&nbsp;founder of Le Cercle, 

